      "trackName": "Yorkie Zoomies for Watch",
      "description": "Yorkie Zoomies for Watch is a fast-paced endless runner built exclusively for Apple Watch.\n\nTurn the Digital Crown to move your Yorkie left and right between three lanes. Dodge obstacles, collect bones, grab power-ups, and see how long you can survive while chasing your highest score.\n\nFeatures\n\n• Built exclusively for Apple Watch\n• Simple Digital Crown controls — rotate the Crown to switch lanes instantly\n• Dodge logs, poop, fire, raccoons, and other obstacles\n• Collect Bones and Golden Bones for bonus points\n• Grab Lightning Boosts to increase your speed and score\n• Experience dynamic day and night gameplay\n• Beat your personal best\n\nEasy to learn. Challenging to master.",
